"""Bridge Pi Drive staging, bounded GitHub effects, and addressed dialogue.

Drive-to-Git projects Pi-authored staging onto Pi's writer-owned refs.
Git-to-Drive projects immutable foreign events addressed to Pi into a Drive
inbox. Git remains canonical. The bridge never imports canonical r1, executes
source content, or checks out an operational ref. Effect records expose only
issues, issue comments, and textual repository documents on the source locus's
attached repository.
"""

